FY 2020 is shown as 673 authorized judgeships in the older edition (JB‑2020, Table X‑1A) and as 674 in the newer edition (JFF‑2025, Table 6.2).  

* First‑published figure 673 (JB‑2020) → revised figure 674 (JFF‑2023 onward) 【...value": 673} 【...value": 674}  

The later Judicial Facts and Figures edition updated the total to 674, while the earlier Judicial Business edition kept the 673 count. Both numbers are official; the newer edition is the current figure.
